  "title": "Pairs Without Legging Risk: Leg 1",
  "summary": "In this first \"leg\" of a two-part series, we show how pairs trading can break down due to timing gaps between legs, introducing unintended transaction costs and risk. OneChronos, built on a design philosophy of coordinated and intentional execution, enables atomic multi-security trades that eliminate legging risk at its source.",
